title: event_spaceDebris
color: purple
position: 0, 0
---
You encounter space debris
-> Slow down
	<<if simple_d_check(80)>>
	You spend some extra time and manage to avoid the worst of it
	<<if spend_fuel(5)>><<endif>>
	<<if pass_time(5)>><<endif>>
	<<else>>
	In spite of the extra time taken the debris still cause minor damage to the ship
	<<if damage_ship(1)>><<endif>>
	<<if spend_fuel(5)>><<endif>>
	<<if pass_time(5)>><<endif>>
	<<endif>>
-> Try to dodge
	<<if stakes_m_check()>>
	You make it through the debris unscathed
	<<else>>
	You managed to dodge directly into a piece of debris. Your ship takes heavy damage
	<<if damage_ship(3)>><<endif>>
	<<endif>>
-> Keep going
	<<if stakes_d_check()>>
	You make it through the debris unscathed
	<<else>>
	This was too optimistic. Your ship takes heavy damage
	<<if damage_ship(3)>><<endif>>
	<<endif>>
