title: event_longExposure
color: purple
position: 0, 0
---
The long route leads to sustained exposure to radiation. This could damage the electronics of the ship.
-> Increase speed and slow down strategically.
	<<if detriment_s_check()>>
	You manage to curb the exposure, but still get affected.
	<<if spend_fuel(5)>><<endif>>
	<<if damage_ship(1)>><<endif>>
	<<else>>
	You increase the speed beyond what the vessel could support damaging it and making you slower in process.
	<<if damage_ship(3)>><<endif>>
	<<if pass_time(5)>><<endif>>
	<<endif>>
-> Keep a steady pace.
	<<if stakes_r_check()>>
	Luckily your radiation protection seems to have been sufficient.
	<<else>>
	Your electronics are heavily damaged but you arrive on time.
	<<if damage_ship(3)>><<endif>>
	<<endif>>
===